    <mxCell id="et8" value="T8: delivered (rej)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=1.8;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#991B1B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s5" target="s7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1422" y="497" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="et7b" value="Missing departure flagged" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=1.8;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0369A1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s3" target="s6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1077" y="172" /><mxPoint x="1760" y="172" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_bg" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="730" width="1870" height="145" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_title" value="Legend &amp; Invariants" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="49" y="736" width="1842" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_text" value="1. Non-state events (audit trail only): arrived_at_center, assigned_to_trip, code_replaced (old code -&gt; void), weight_corrected, outcome_corrected.&lt;br/&gt;2. Offline reconciliation: immutable sack_event_log folded by recorded_at + event_id; physical receiver (T3/T4/T7/T8) applies even if pickup/departure delayed.&lt;br/&gt;3. Transporter &amp; center offline resilience: &gt;=7d GNSS / custody outbox (2,016 fixes); center holds &gt;=400 pre-issued reserve codes for unlabeled arrivals.&lt;br/&gt;4. Stores &amp; recovery: DynamoDB (KMS records) + buyer_view projection (KMS public_view, origin/dates/status/drying vars only); RPO 15 min (S3 export) / RTO 4 h.&lt;br/&gt;5. Dashed lines = offline/receiver-authoritative skip path or rejection transition; bold border = terminal state." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="49" y="758" width="1842" height="113" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
  </root>
</mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
